###### 3.1.4 *Ordinary* and *HO* Methods of Function $springForce$
(cf. Walck, 2023, p.71)

Here we use Julia's *multiple dispatch*. We code one unary *higher-order* *method* of function $springForceFO$ with a *functional* output and one *ordinary* binary *method* of function $springForce$ with *numeric* output.

$\text{------------- higher-order with functional output -----------------}$
