- functional:

$F(x) \approx \int_0^x f(x') dx'$

$Fs(x) = \int_0^x x'^2 dx'$

- vectorial:

$Fvs(x) \approx c + \Delta x \sum_{i=1}^n [...,f(x)[i],...]$


"

