###### 3.9.4 *Acceleration* from *Jerk* in *Scotch-Yoke-Oscillator*

###### 1. *Method*: $F_a(t)=acceleration(t)$ with Function Parameter $f_j(t)=jerk(t)$

$F_a(t) = a(t) = a(0) + \int_0^t f_j(t') dt' \approx c + \Delta t \sum_{i=1}^t f_j(t_i)\;;\; t_i \le t$

